["At medical levels diphenhydramine is simply sedating. Far above that, it becomes a deliriant: confusion, muttering, and realistic hallucinations such as shadow people, insects, or imaginary objects.","People often cannot tell hallucinations from reality, and many describe dark, threatening figures ('the hat man').","It can cause seizures and dangerous heart rhythms, and combination products add acetaminophen or ibuprofen toxicity."],
